WEBVTT

00:04:29.507 --> 00:04:31.663
a happy Africa view

00:04:31.687 --> 00:04:33.715
where children are strangely traumatized

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:35.682
by their mother's dark sense of humor,

00:04:35.706 --> 00:04:36.743
(Laughter)

00:04:36.767 --> 00:04:41.329
but also they're claiming fun,
fierce and frivolous art

00:04:41.353 --> 00:04:45.558
in the name of all things
unseriously African.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.712
Because we're AfroBubbleGumists

00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:51.589
and there's so many more of us
than you can imagine.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:53.294
Thank you so much.

00:04:53.318 --> 00:04:57.149
(Applause)